<title>SRI LANKA: Haycarb in bonus announcement.</title>
<headline>Haycarb in bonus announcement.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Haycarb Ltd said it was making a bonus issue of one new share for every six held on Monday.</p>
<p>The company is a subsidiary of the blue chip Hayleys Ltd.</p>
<p>The company's issued capital will rise accordingly to 19.4 million shares, from 16.6 million.</p>
<p>The firm manufactures and exports activated carbon.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
